# Tom: Thanksgiving's ball (Tom to the Table), as Jack is Halloween's. A
# cartoon roast turkey: a rounded golden-brown roast, browner underneath,
# two drumsticks at the back with bone tips, a glowing glaze on top, and
# eyes, since he talks. Jack-sized. Generated as slices; edit freely.
